    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "2.2 核算方法"
    },
    {
      "kind": "fixed_text",
      "key": "method_total_intro",
      "text": "根据《陆上运输指南》的规定，陆上运输企业的温室气体排放总量等于企业边界内燃料燃烧CO2排放、运输车辆在尾气净化过程中由于使用尿素等还原剂产生的CO2排放量、净购入的电力和热力隐含的CO2排放之和，按式（1）计算："
    },
    {
      "kind": "fixed_text",
      "key": "method_total_formula",
      "text": "EGHG = E燃烧 + E过程 + ECO2_净电 + ECO2_净热（1）"
    },
    {
      "kind": "fixed_text",
      "key": "method_terms_label",
      "text": "式中："
    },
    {
      "kind": "table_role",
      "role": "formula_total"
    },
    {
      "kind": "fixed_text",
      "key": "method_no_urea",
      "text": "铁路运输不涉及运输车辆在尾气净化过程中由于使用尿素等还原剂产生的CO2排放量。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "text": "2.2.1 燃料燃烧CO2排放"
    },
    {
      "kind": "fixed_text",
      "key": "method_fuel_intro",
      "text": "化石燃料燃烧导致的二氧化碳排放量是基于分品种的燃料消耗量、单位燃料的含碳量和碳氧化率计算得到，按式（2）计算："
    },
    {
      "kind": "fixed_text",
      "key": "method_fuel_formula",
      "text": "ECO2_燃烧 = ∑i（ADi × CCi × OFi × 44/12）（2）"
    },
    {
      "kind": "fixed_text",
      "key": "method_terms_label",
      "text": "式中："
    },
    {
      "kind": "table_role",
      "role": "formula_fuel"
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "text": "2.2.2 净购入电力隐含的CO2排放"
    },
    {
      "kind": "fixed_text",
      "key": "method_electricity_intro",
      "text": "企业净购入的电力消费引起的CO2排放按公式（3）计算："
    },
    {
      "kind": "fixed_text",
      "key": "method_electricity_formula",
      "text": "ECO2_净电 = AD净电 × EF电力（3）"
    },
    {
      "kind": "fixed_text",
      "key": "method_terms_label",
      "text": "式中："
    },
    {
      "kind": "table_role",
      "role": "formula_electricity"
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "text": "2.2.3 净购入热力隐含的CO2排放"
    },
    {
      "kind": "fixed_text",
      "key": "method_heat_intro",
      "text": "企业净购入的热力消费引起的CO2排放按公式（4）计算："
    },
    {
      "kind": "fixed_text",
      "key": "method_heat_formula",
      "text": "ECO2_净热 = AD净热 × EF热力（4）"
    },
    {
      "kind": "fixed_text",
      "key": "method_terms_label",
      "text": "式中："
    },
    {
      "kind": "table_role",
      "role": "formula_heat"
    },
